# Chelsea
tags: girls, benchmark
stimulus: Cindy, one round per minute, for 30 minutes.
note: Score is the number of minutes completed. If a round is not finished inside its minute, the workout is over (or continue as an AMRAP and record where you fell off).
EMOM 30
5 Pull-up
10 Push-up
15 Air squat

Scaled:
  Pull-up -> Ring row
  Push-up -> Knee push-up
